.SS "#define SCHULTZ_CLIPBOARD_TEXT   'text/plain;charset=utf\-8'"

.PP
The format for plain text, which is what a clipboard nearly always holds\&. Formats are named the way the platforms name them, as media types\&. Every clipboard underneath this one negotiates: the side copying says what it can produce, the side pasting picks what it understands\&. So the same copy can be plain text in a text box and something richer in an editor, and nobody had to choose a mode\&. 
.PP
