.RS 4
\fIcontext\fP The pointer given to schultz_tree_clipboard_offer\&. 
.br
\fIformat\fP Which of the offered formats is wanted\&. 
.br
\fIout_length\fP Receives how many bytes\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The bytes, which must stay valid until the next clipboard call, or NULL when this format cannot be produced after all\&. 
.RE
