.SS "int32_t schultz_node_set_widget (\fBschultz_tree\fP * tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node, const \fBschultz_widget_vtable\fP * vtable, void * data)"

.PP
Gives a node a widget type and its state\&. The node takes ownership of \fCdata\fP: it is passed to the vtable's \fCdestroy\fP when the node is destroyed or when a different widget replaces this one\&.
.PP
