.br
\fInode\fP The node to turn into a widget\&. 
.br
\fIvtable\fP The widget's function table, or NULL to remove one\&. It must outlive the node; the built in widgets have static storage\&. 
.br
\fIdata\fP The widget's state, or NULL\&. Owned by the node from here\&. 
.RE
